---
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import Fill from '../components/Fill.astro';
import { OWNER } from '../config/legal';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Contact and corrections"
  description="How to reach B2BRated, report a mistake, or ask about your personal data."
  path="/contact"
>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    Write to <Fill value={OWNER.email} label="contact email" />. There is no contact form, no phone line and no chat. We
    read every message, and we have not set a reply time yet.
  </p>

  <h2>Report a mistake or send a correction</h2>
  <p>This applies to vendors and to readers. Include three things:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>the address of the page on this site,</li>
    <li>what is wrong,</li>
    <li>a link to a public page that shows the correct fact, such as a pricing page, documentation or a terms page.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We open the link. If it supports the correction we change the page. If we disagree, we tell you why. We do not change
    a fact only because a vendor asks, and payment has no effect on a correction.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions about your personal data</h2>
  <p>
    Send them to the same address and put "privacy" in the subject. The <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a> lists
    your rights.
  </p>

  <h2>Press, partnerships and vendors</h2>
  <p>
    Use the same address. We do not sell placement in rankings, and a message from a vendor does not change where a
    product appears. See the <a href="/advertising-disclosure">advertising and sponsorship page</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
